@@ -0,0 +1,210 @@
+/*
+** Dn-FamiTracker - NES/Famicom sound tracker
+** Copyright (C) 2020-2025 D.P.C.M.
+** FamiTracker Copyright (C) 2005-2020 Jonathan Liss
+** 0CC-FamiTracker Copyright (C) 2014-2018 HertzDevil
